{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09469","headline":"古剑行 · 韦应物","name":"古剑行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千年土中两刃铁，土蚀不入金星灭。\n沈沈青脊鳞甲满，蛟龙无足蛇尾断。\n忽欲飞动中有灵，豪士得之敌国宝。\n仇家举意半夜鸣，小儿女子不可近。\n龙蛇变化此中隐，夏云奔走雷阗阗，恐成霹雳飞上天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}